<BaseLayout title="Lockout Checklist | Daniel's Lock & Key" description="Safe, calm steps before requesting authorized lockout entry in Hollywood and nearby Los Angeles communities."><section class="page-hero"><div class="shell"><p class="kicker">Before you call</p><h1>A calm lockout checklist.</h1></div></section><section class="section shell detail"><div><ol><li>Move to a safe and well-lit place.</li><li>Check only authorized alternative entrances without forcing anything.</li><li>Contact a household member, landlord, manager, or roadside provider when appropriate.</li><li>Prepare ID and proof of authorized access.</li><li>Describe exactly what happened when you call.</li></ol></div><aside><h2>Talk to Daniel</h2><a class="pill" href={`tel:${site.phoneHref}`}>{site.phone}</a></aside></section></BaseLayout>
